---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund and Cancellation Policy for Tirol Analytics sports data analytics platform"
>
  <style>
    /* 暗い背景を完全に覆う */
    :global(.main-content) {
      background: white !important;
      margin-top: 0 !important;
      padding-top: 80px !important;
    }

    .legal-page {
      padding: 4rem 0;
      background: white;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
    }

    .legal-content {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .legal-content h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: #1f2937;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .last-updated {
      color: #6b7280;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      color: #2563eb;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-content p {
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #374151;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      list-style: disc;
      margin-left: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #374151;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .highlight-box {
      background: #f0f9ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .highlight-box h3 {
      color: #1e40af;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .legal-content h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      .legal-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-content">
      <h1>Refund and Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: October 2, 2026</p>

      <!-- Language Notice -->
      <div class="highlight-box" style="background: #fef3c7; border-left-color: #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h3 style="color: #92400e;">⚠️ Important Notice</h3>
        <p style="color: #92400e; font-weight: 500;">
          This service and all contractual terms are provided in English only.<br>
          By using this service, you confirm that you understand and agree to these terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Subscription Cancellation</h2>
      <p>
        Monthly plans paid by credit card (Premium / Premium JRA / Premium NANKAN) can be cancelled from the "Payment management" button on your dashboard (My Page), or by contacting us at analytics@tirol.link. There is no minimum contract period. Upon cancellation:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>The next renewal is stopped; you will not be charged for subsequent billing periods</li>
        <li>Your access continues until the end of the billing period you have already paid for</li>
        <li>No prorated refunds are provided for the remaining days of the current billing period</li>
        <li>Your account data will be retained for 90 days, after which it may be permanently deleted</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Because the Service provides digital content that is available immediately after payment, payments are not refundable once completed. This applies to monthly plans, annual and lifetime plans paid by bank transfer, and the Premium Plus one-time purchase.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>No prorated refunds are provided when a subscription is cancelled</li>
        <li>Exceptions: refunds required by applicable law, duplicate or erroneous charges caused by us, or cases where the Service was not provided at all due to reasons attributable to us</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Payment Issues and Disputes</h2>
      <p>
        If you believe you were charged in error, or have any payment-related issue, please contact us at <a href="mailto:analytics@tirol.link" style="color: #2563eb;">analytics@tirol.link</a> with your registered email address so we can assist you promptly.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to modify this Refund Policy at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. Your continued use of our Service after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new policy.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Refund Policy, please contact us at:
        <br><br>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:analytics@tirol.link" style="color: #2563eb;">analytics@tirol.link</a><br>
        <strong>Seller:</strong> tirol data labo（<a href="https://analytics.tirol.link/tokushoho/" style="color: #2563eb;">特定商取引法に基づく表記</a>）
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
